## Commits
### de10f83
test(core): cover five reachable branches of derive, effect and batch

The lcov report for src/index.ts lists branches that any caller of the
public API can reach but no test exercised: the derive proxy's get trap
for an unknown property and its set trap for a property other than
reactive, the infinite-loop message for a named effect, the scheduler's
already-queued return reached through array mutating methods inside a
batch, and the dirty-target flush in the hooks path of batch(). Pin
each with a test in the behavior file for its subject so the coverage
gate can be switched on without excluding any of them.

Core-module unhit branches go from 23 to 18 (BRH 515 to 523).


